# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo on every platform. Skills and
# scripts are read across Windows, WSL, and macOS, and CRLF on a Windows
# checkout makes every skill file hash as "locally modified" against the
# LF-based content the skill registry recorded — `paniolo skills update`
# then refuses to touch any of them, not just genuinely customized ones.
* text=auto eol=lf
